# Cool but Rude at level 2: "whenever you discard a card, this Class deals 2 damage to each opponent" triggers once per
# card (not "one or more"). Turn 3: Bot1 levels it up, then Faithless Looting discards Lightning Bolt and a Plains
# together: two triggers, Bot2 to 16. Bot1 then attacks with Ornithopter (power 0) and the attack loot discards a Plains:
# one more, Bot2 to 14. Turn 4: Bot2 discards two cards to its own Faithless Looting; they are not Bot1's discards, so
# nothing triggers and Bot1 stays at 20.

